            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Why is the dirt pick-up/suction power under performing?",
            "text": "<p>This can be due to:<br/><br/>1. A full or clogged dust bin.<br/>2. The filters need cleaning. <br/>3. The flexible hose is worn. To replace the hose, contact the aftersales helpline.<br/>4. The brushroll is worn. Contact the after sales helpline for assistance.<br/>5. The foam and felt filters are dirty or worn. Clean the foam and felt filters. Replace these if they are worn or broken.<br/>6. There is a clog in the flexible hose or connection hose of the vacuum cleaner</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
