          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "full_width_enable": true,
            "title": "Why is dust escaping from the vacuum?",
            "text": "<p>This can be due to:<br/><br/>1. The HEPA exhaust filter is damaged and needs to be replaced. Replace the exhaust filter. To purchase online at www.clevaeurope.com.<br/>2. The Dust bin is installed incorrectly. Position dust bin correctly and snap firmly in place.<br/>3. The HEPA exhaust filter is installed incorrectly. Check exhaust filter for correct installation.</p>",
